// GetDataset Read a dataset (F3 pull)
//
// The current version of a dataset. Token scope cis.read.
//
// Without a filter: the stored snapshot of the version (the bytes
// the CISP signed; X-CIS-Signature is its compact detached JWS
// over them), gzip when Accept-Encoding allows it. ED-318 datasets
// are application/geo+json with metadata.issued (the version's
// received_at) and the top-level cis_dataset, cis_version and
// cis_updated_at; ussp_list is the UsspList with the same cis_*
// members, application/json.
//
// Filters (ED-318 datasets only: on ussp_list bbox, at and
// applies_at are 400 filter_not_applicable):
//   - bbox=minlng,minlat,maxlng,maxlat keeps the features whose
//     stored shape's bounding box overlaps the box: a prefilter,
//     never a judgement (a circle is its stored buffer, LESSONS
//     Z-11). Finite numbers, longitudes -180..180, latitudes
//     -90..90, min not above max; a box across the antimeridian
//     (minlng above maxlng) is refused 400 for now.
//   - at=<RFC 3339 with an offset> keeps the features that apply at
//     that instant (uspace-core ed318.Applies at the feature's
//     centroid, NOAA daylight) and keeps every feature whose
//     applicability cannot be evaluated, marked
//     extendedProperties.cis_applicability "unknown": never dropped.
//     A time without an offset is 400; encode + as %2B.
//   - applies_at=<RFC 3339 with an offset> annotates without
//     filtering: every feature carries
//     extendedProperties.cis_applicability applies, not_applicable
//     or unknown at that instant. With at it is 400 filter_conflict.
//   - since_version=v is the DatasetDelta from v to the current
//     version (application/json): 400 when v is above the current
//     version, 410 delta_unavailable when it is more than 1000
//     versions back (pull the dataset whole). ussp_list has no
//     features: there since_version answers the whole list.
//
// A filtered response is built from the current features, carries
// X-CIS-Filtered naming the filters and the version's ETag, and is
// not signed (docs/PLAN.md section 15 Q22).
//
// If-None-Match with the current ETag is 304. When the database
// cannot be reached, an unfiltered read serves the snapshot the
// instance holds with X-CIS-Stale true, X-CIS-Age-S and
// Cache-Control no-store; a filtered read is 503 cis_stale with
// Retry-After. A dataset never published is 404 no_version.
