// GetPublicDatasetWithResponse The public read of a dataset (no token)
//
// GET /v1/{dataset} without a token, rate-limited per client
// address: the same snapshots, filters (bbox, at, applies_at) and
// headers, X-CIS-Signature on unfiltered ED-318 reads. No
// since_version (400), no versions and no change feed here. The
// USSP list is projected without base_url and certificate_id
